2. Static helper `contains_bytes` — O(n·m) byte-substring search using `memcmp`
3. Static `search_stream` — the semantic anchor; reads a `FILE*` byte-by-byte via `fgetc`, accumulates lines in a dynamically-grown buffer, emits matching lines (with optional prefix) to stdout, returns match count, sets `*had_error` on failure
